.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-06T16:34:41Z","updated_at":"2025-03-06T16:34:41Z","body":"> Bisected to [#97465](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/97465), CC [@DarioSamo](https://github.com/DarioSamo)\n> \n> ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b88ad8ec-38b8-4ce6-ac55-9a244f4a5b6d)\n\nI merely pushed this commit for @reduz but I didn't really write it beyond reviewing the code. It's up for grabs for anyone I'd say.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2704358240/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2704402988","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103650#issuecomment-2704402988","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103650","id":2704402988,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hMeos","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-06T16:52:55Z","updated_at":"2025-03-06T16:52:55Z","body":"The last error is the one to focus on\n\n```\nE 0:00:42:155   _allocate_rid: Element limit reached.\n  <C++ Error>   Method/function failed. Returning: RID()\n  <C++ Source>  ./core/templates/rid_owner.h:133 @ _allocate_rid()\n```\n\nI assume that something in physics server 2D is creating excessive new RIDs and eventually causing the RIDOwner to run out of RIDs. \n\nIn Godot 4.3 the limit on RIDs was basically UINT32_MAX, and now it is around 250,000. So you reach the limit much faster now. \n\nWe need to investigate why physics 2D is creating so many RIDs. If they are necessary we can simply increase the limit. We may also be leaking RIDs, in which case we need to fix the leak","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2704402988/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2746332308","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103650#issuecomment-2746332308","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103650","id":2746332308,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jsbSU","user":{"login":"hunterbk","id":36772761,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NzcyNzYx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36772761?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hunterbk","html_url":"https://gi